<title>UK: UK new car registrations up 7.3 pct in June - SMMT.</title>
<headline>UK new car registrations up 7.3 pct in June - SMMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK new car registrations rose 7.3 percent in June to 151,620, the Society of Motor Manufacturers and Traders said on Friday.</p>
</text>
